00:10:52,777 --> 00:10:55,428
If an owner drives three thousand miles

280
00:10:55,428 --> 00:10:57,739
a year at twelve miles per gallon,

281
00:10:57,739 --> 00:11:00,050
that is two hundred fifty gallons,

282
00:11:00,050 --> 00:11:02,701
or about one thousand two hundred fifty

283
00:11:02,701 --> 00:11:04,944
dollars at five dollars a gallon.

284
00:11:05,124 --> 00:11:07,585
Again, that is our example.

285
00:11:07,765 --> 00:11:10,150
Compared with the price of the car,

286
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:12,467
fuel is close to a rounding error.

287
00:11:12,818 --> 00:11:14,362
And the battery helps a little.

288
00:11:14,542 --> 00:11:17,336
Kelley Blue Book lists a charge time

289
00:11:17,336 --> 00:11:19,433
of about two hours on a two

290
00:11:19,433 --> 00:11:21,451
hundred forty volt outlet,

291
00:11:21,451 --> 00:11:24,634
and Wikipedia lists about ten kilometers,

292
00:11:24,634 --> 00:11:25,643
or six miles,

293
00:11:25,643 --> 00:11:28,671
of electric range on the European test.

294
00:11:28,851 --> 00:11:31,174
For a short drive in the city,

295
00:11:31,174 --> 00:11:33,575
an owner can use the Citta mode

296
00:11:33,575 --> 00:11:35,434
and burn no fuel at all.

297
00:11:35,784 --> 00:11:38,766
Now service, and this is where Lamborghini

298
00:11:38,766 --> 00:11:41,252
is less open than you might expect.

299
00:11:41,432 --> 00:11:44,092
Kelley Blue Book lists a warranty of

300
00:11:44,092 --> 00:11:47,121
three years with unlimited miles for both

301
00:11:47,121 --> 00:11:49,338
basic and powertrain coverage.

302
00:11:49,518 --> 00:11:52,152
But Lamborghini does not publish a public

303
00:11:52,152 --> 00:11:54,722
price list for Revuelto servicing in the

304
00:11:54,722 --> 00:11:56,136
sources we could find.

305
00:11:56,486 --> 00:12:00,002
Even dealers that advertise fixed-price servicing do

306
00:12:00,002 --> 00:12:01,896
not always show the numbers.

307
00:12:02,076 --> 00:12:04,458
H R Owen in the United Kingdom,

308
00:12:04,458 --> 00:12:07,454
one of the biggest Lamborghini dealers,

309
00:12:07,454 --> 00:12:10,988
lists its fixed-price services for the Huracan

310
00:12:10,988 --> 00:12:13,908
and Aventador as price on application,

311
00:12:13,908 --> 00:12:16,443
and does not list the Revuelto at

312
00:12:16,443 --> 00:12:16,751
all.

313
00:12:16,931 --> 00:12:18,022
You have to ask.

314
00:12:18,373 --> 00:12:22,606
Some websites publish estimates for Revuelto servicing,

315
00:12:22,606 --> 00:12:24,839
but the ones we found gave no

316
00:12:24,839 --> 00:12:26,301
sources or methods,

317
00:12:26,301 --> 00:12:28,534
so we are not quoting them as

318
00:12:28,534 --> 00:12:28,996
facts.

319
00:12:29,176 --> 00:12:31,399
What we can say is that a

320
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:33,533
Revuelto combines a V12,

321
00:12:33,533 --> 00:12:35,489
three electric motors,

322
00:12:35,489 --> 00:12:37,535
a high-voltage battery,

323
00:12:37,535 --> 00:12:41,714
carbon-ceramic brakes, and active aerodynamics.

324
00:12:41,894 --> 00:12:45,412
Each one needs specialist tools and training.

325
00:12:45,763 --> 00:12:47,191
Here is the twist.

326
00:12:47,371 --> 00:12:49,823
The hybrid system may actually help with

327
00:12:49,823 --> 00:12:50,436
some wear.

328
00:12:50,616 --> 00:12:53,721
The front motors recover energy when slowing

329
00:12:53,721 --> 00:12:56,120
down, which can take some load off

330
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:56,897
the brakes.

331
00:12:57,077 --> 00:13:00,302
And the new dual-clutch gearbox replaces the

332
00:13:00,302 --> 00:13:03,307
Aventador's single-clutch robotized unit,

333
00:13:03,307 --> 00:13:05,726
which reviewers often criticized.

334
00:13:05,906 --> 00:13:07,850
But the battery adds a component that

335
00:13:07,850 --> 00:13:09,110
the Aventador never had.

336
00:13:09,461 --> 00:13:11,690
The brakes alone show the scale.

337
00:13:11,870 --> 00:13:15,279
Wikipedia lists carbon-ceramic discs of four hundred

338
00:13:15,279 --> 00:13:18,165
ten millimeters at the front with ten-piston

339
00:13:18,165 --> 00:13:20,853
calipers, and three hundred ninety at the

340
00:13:20,853 --> 00:13:21,181
rear.

341
00:13:21,361 --> 00:13:24,513
Carbon-ceramic brakes last a long time with

342
00:13:24,513 --> 00:13:27,518
normal use, but when they need replacing,

343
00:13:27,518 --> 00:13:30,377
they are among the most expensive parts

344
00:13:30,377 --> 00:13:31,183
on any car.

345
00:13:31,533 --> 00:13:34,240
Now the part where the Revuelto surprises

346
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:34,702
people.

347
00:13:34,882 --> 00:13:37,049
Most cars lose a big part of

348
00:13:37,049 --> 00:13:39,758
their value in the first two years.

349
00:13:39,938 --> 00:13:42,063
In October twenty twenty-six,

350
00:13:42,063 --> 00:13:45,945
autoevolution looked at a twenty twenty-four Revuelto

351
00:13:45,945 --> 00:13:48,143
with about six thousand miles,

352
00:13:48,143 --> 00:13:51,733
offered for six hundred twenty-nine thousand nine

353
00:13:51,733 --> 00:13:53,417
hundred eighty dollars.

354
00:13:53,768 --> 00:13:56,854
The same article said used Revueltos start

355
00:13:56,854 --> 00:14:00,014
around six hundred thousand dollars and can

356
00:14:00,014 --> 00:14:02,585
reach almost nine hundred thousand,

357
00:14:02,585 --> 00:14:04,129
depending on mileage,

358
00:14:04,129 --> 00:14:05,819
condition, and options.

359
00:14:05,999 --> 00:14:06,969
For early cars,

360
00:14:06,969 --> 00:14:09,232
that is not far from their original

361
00:14:09,232 --> 00:14:09,749
sticker.

362
00:14:09,929 --> 00:14:11,162
In other words,

363
00:14:11,162 --> 00:14:14,041
a buyer who got an early allocation

364
00:14:14,041 --> 00:14:15,851
has often lost little,

365
00:14:15,851 --> 00:14:17,742
if any, value on paper.

366
00:14:18,093 --> 00:14:18,348
Why?

367
00:14:18,528 --> 00:14:20,866
Partly because the car was sold out

368
00:14:20,866 --> 00:14:23,138
for years, so people who could not

369
00:14:23,138 --> 00:14:25,476
get an allocation paid a premium to

370
00:14:25,476 --> 00:14:26,411
skip the line.

371
00:14:26,591 --> 00:14:30,042
Motor Authority reported back in twenty twenty-three

372
00:14:30,042 --> 00:14:32,830
that the only alternatives were waiting or

373
00:14:32,830 --> 00:14:35,484
paying hefty markups on the used market.

374
00:14:35,664 --> 00:14:37,650
Scarcity protects value.

375
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,578
But here is the twist.

376
00:14:39,758 --> 00:14:43,265
A new, faster version now exists.

377
00:14:43,445 --> 00:14:45,795
In August twenty twenty-six,

378
00:14:45,795 --> 00:14:48,984
Lamborghini revealed the Revuelto S V,

379
00:14:48,984 --> 00:14:52,760
with about one thousand fifty-one horsepower,

380
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:55,278
eighty percent more downforce,

381
00:14:55,278 --> 00:14:58,803
and a Hockenheim lap record for production

382
00:14:58,803 --> 00:15:01,069
cars, according to Auto123.

383
00:15:01,249 --> 00:15:04,267
Motor1 reported a United States order sheet

384
00:15:04,267 --> 00:15:07,426
price of seven hundred forty-one thousand one

385
00:15:07,426 --> 00:15:10,444
hundred seventy-two dollars before options.

386
00:15:10,794 --> 00:15:12,680
When a faster version arrives,

387
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:14,693
the regular car can lose some of

388
00:15:14,693 --> 00:15:16,517
its shine on the used market.

389
00:15:16,697 --> 00:15:18,097
On the other hand,

390
00:15:18,097 --> 00:15:20,040
the S V is limited to one

391
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:23,072
thousand nine hundred sixty-three cars,

392
00:15:23,072 --> 00:15:25,405
mostly for existing customers.

393
00:15:25,585 --> 00:15:28,854
That could keep demand for regular Revueltos

394
00:15:28,854 --> 00:15:31,752
strong among buyers who could never get

395
00:15:31,752 --> 00:15:32,272
an S V.

396
00:15:32,452 --> 00:15:35,053
Nobody can promise which way it goes.

397
00:15:35,403 --> 00:15:37,968
Now a question most videos skip.

398
00:15:38,148 --> 00:15:40,272
How do people actually pay for a

399
00:15:40,272 --> 00:15:41,202
car like this?

400
00:15:41,382 --> 00:15:44,203
Many buyers at this level pay cash.

401
00:15:44,383 --> 00:15:45,555
But some finance,

402
00:15:45,555 --> 00:15:48,175
or lease, to keep their money invested

403
00:15:48,175 --> 00:15:48,864
elsewhere.

404
00:15:49,044 --> 00:15:51,750
Let's do a clearly simple example of

405
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:53,930
our own, using round numbers,

406
00:15:53,930 --> 00:15:56,861
to show what financing a Revuelto would

407
00:15:56,861 --> 00:15:57,613
look like.

408
00:15:57,963 --> 00:16:00,143
Take a car at about eight hundred

409
00:16:00,143 --> 00:16:02,456
sixty thousand dollars on the road.

410
00:16:02,636 --> 00:16:04,258
Put twenty percent down,

411
00:16:04,258 --> 00:16:07,639
which is one hundred seventy-two thousand dollars.

412
00:16:07,819 --> 00:16:11,528
Finance the remaining six hundred eighty-eight thousand

413
00:16:11,528 --> 00:16:14,359
over seventy-two months at an example rate

414
00:16:14,359 --> 00:16:15,505
of seven percent.

415
00:16:15,685 --> 00:16:18,253
The monthly payment comes out to about

416
00:16:18,253 --> 00:16:21,293
eleven thousand seven hundred thirty dollars.

417
00:16:21,643 --> 00:16:22,763
Over six years,

418
00:16:22,763 --> 00:16:25,677
the interest alone in that example adds

419
00:16:25,677 --> 00:16:28,816
up to about one hundred fifty-six thousand

420
00:16:28,816 --> 00:16:30,385
five hundred dollars.

421
00:16:30,565 --> 00:16:32,725
That is more than the total cost

422
00:16:32,725 --> 00:16:35,290
of the options on Jalopnik's test car.

423
00:16:35,470 --> 00:16:37,260
So for a financed buyer,

424
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:39,571
the loan can cost more than the

425
00:16:39,571 --> 00:16:41,360
carbon fiber, the paint,

426
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,597
and the audio system combined.

427
00:16:43,947 --> 00:16:45,290
And for cash buyers,

428
00:16:45,290 --> 00:16:47,104
there is a hidden cost too.

429
00:16:47,284 --> 00:16:48,933
Money in a car is money not

430
00:16:48,933 --> 00:16:50,582
earning anything elsewhere.

431
00:16:50,762 --> 00:16:52,526
As another simple example,

432
00:16:52,526 --> 00:16:55,578
if eight hundred sixty thousand dollars could

433
00:16:55,578 --> 00:16:57,546
earn four percent a year in a

434
00:16:57,546 --> 00:17:00,802
savings product, that would be about thirty-four

435
00:17:00,802 --> 00:17:03,312
thousand four hundred dollars a year.

436
00:17:03,492 --> 00:17:06,940
Economists call that an opportunity cost.

437
00:17:07,291 --> 00:17:08,765
Here is the twist.

438
00:17:08,945 --> 00:17:11,318
With a car that holds its value

439
00:17:11,318 --> 00:17:13,768
well, like many early Revueltos,

440
00:17:13,768 --> 00:17:16,754
the opportunity cost can be the biggest

441
00:17:16,754 --> 00:17:18,208
yearly cost of all,

442
00:17:18,208 --> 00:17:19,893
bigger than insurance,

443
00:17:19,893 --> 00:17:21,960
fuel, and service together.

444
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:24,401
The car may not lose much value,

445
00:17:24,401 --> 00:17:26,520
but the money inside it is not

446
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:27,086
growing.

447
00:17:27,436 --> 00:17:29,522
To guess the Revuelto's future,

448
00:17:29,522 --> 00:17:31,406
look at the car it replaced.

449
00:17:31,586 --> 00:17:34,955
The Aventador was built from twenty eleven

450
00:17:34,955 --> 00:17:36,639
to twenty twenty-two,

451
00:17:36,639 --> 00:17:38,965
and reports at the end of its

452
00:17:38,965 --> 00:17:42,414
run put production at about eleven thousand

453
00:17:42,414 --> 00:17:44,740
four hundred sixty-five cars.

454
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:47,354
That is a lot of V12 Lamborghinis,

455
00:17:47,354 --> 00:17:50,217
and it meant that used Aventadors became

456
00:17:50,217 --> 00:17:52,579
much easier to find than new ones

457
00:17:52,579 --> 00:17:53,581
were to order.

458
00:17:53,932 --> 00:17:56,636
The Revuelto is built in much smaller

459
00:17:56,636 --> 00:17:57,879
numbers per year.

460
00:17:58,059 --> 00:18:01,303
Wikipedia lists one thousand four hundred six

461
00:18:01,303 --> 00:18:02,889
in twenty twenty-four.

462
00:18:03,069 --> 00:18:05,889
If production stays at a similar pace

463
00:18:05,889 --> 00:18:07,184
over a long life,

464
00:18:07,184 --> 00:18:09,547
the total could still be large.

465
00:18:09,727 --> 00:18:11,477
And the larger the total,

466
00:18:11,477 --> 00:18:14,068
the more the used market behaves like

467
00:18:14,068 --> 00:18:16,658
a normal luxury car market over time.

468
00:18:17,009 --> 00:18:18,367
The lesson is simple.

469
00:18:18,547 --> 00:18:22,111
Short-term values are protected by waiting lists.

470
00:18:22,291 --> 00:18:24,750
Long-term values depend on how many cars

471
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:27,086
are built and how they are remembered.

472
00:18:27,266 --> 00:18:30,130
The Revuelto is the first hybrid V12

473
00:18:30,130 --> 00:18:33,710
Lamborghini, which may help it be remembered.

474
00:18:33,890 --> 00:18:35,825
But no source can tell you what

475
00:18:35,825 --> 00:18:37,698
it will be worth in ten years.

476
00:18:38,048 --> 00:18:39,790
So let's add it up for one

477
00:18:39,790 --> 00:18:42,336
example car, using the numbers in this

478
00:18:42,336 --> 00:18:42,738
video.

479
00:18:42,918 --> 00:18:46,004
Jalopnik's test car came to eight hundred

480
00:18:46,004 --> 00:18:49,390
six thousand five hundred twenty-one dollars,

481
00:18:49,390 --> 00:18:51,723
including options, destination,

482
00:18:51,723 --> 00:18:53,529
and the gas guzzler tax.

483
00:18:53,709 --> 00:18:56,401
Add an example seven percent sales tax,

484
00:18:56,401 --> 00:18:58,817
and the car is around eight hundred

485
00:18:58,817 --> 00:19:01,233
sixty thousand dollars on the road.

486
00:19:01,583 --> 00:19:04,905
Add insurance at MoneyGeek's estimate of about

487
00:19:04,905 --> 00:19:07,866
six thousand five hundred dollars a year,

488
00:19:07,866 --> 00:19:10,682
fuel of around one thousand two hundred

489
00:19:10,682 --> 00:19:13,282
fifty dollars a year in our example,

490
00:19:13,282 --> 00:19:16,316
and service at whatever the dealer quotes.

491
00:19:16,496 --> 00:19:17,605
Over three years,

492
00:19:17,605 --> 00:19:20,020
the running costs we can document are

493
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:22,369
in the tens of thousands of dollars,

494
00:19:22,369 --> 00:19:24,327
small next to the price of the

495
00:19:24,327 --> 00:19:24,588
car.

496
00:19:24,938 --> 00:19:26,980
And then the biggest number,

497
00:19:26,980 --> 00:19:29,824
depreciation, may be smaller than for a

498
00:19:29,824 --> 00:19:31,137
normal luxury car.

499
00:19:31,317 --> 00:19:33,503
If a two-year-old car can sell for

500
00:19:33,503 --> 00:19:36,267
around six hundred thirty thousand dollars,

501
00:19:36,267 --> 00:19:38,516
the loss compared with a base price

502
00:19:38,516 --> 00:19:40,573
in the mid six hundreds could be

503
00:19:40,573 --> 00:19:41,023
modest.

504
00:19:41,203 --> 00:19:43,665
But options rarely hold their value.

505
00:19:43,845 --> 00:19:46,577
Those carbon packs and that special paint

506
00:19:46,577 --> 00:19:48,576
are worth far less to the next

507
00:19:48,576 --> 00:19:48,976
buyer.

508
00:19:49,327 --> 00:19:51,883
So the real cost of a Revuelto

509
00:19:51,883 --> 00:19:54,609
is not mainly fuel or insurance.

510
00:19:54,789 --> 00:19:56,763
It is the options you choose and

511
00:19:56,763 --> 00:19:58,614
the timing of when you buy and

512
00:19:58,614 --> 00:19:58,922
sell.

513
00:19:59,102 --> 00:20:01,224
An early buyer with a simple spec

514
00:20:01,224 --> 00:20:02,574
can lose very little.

515
00:20:02,754 --> 00:20:04,986
A late buyer with a heavy spec

516
00:20:04,986 --> 00:20:07,293
who sells after the S V arrives

517
00:20:07,293 --> 00:20:08,559
could lose a lot.

518
00:20:08,909 --> 00:20:11,474
And then there is the Ferrari alternative.

519
00:20:11,654 --> 00:20:14,315
Kelley Blue Book lists the Ferrari twelve

520
00:20:14,315 --> 00:20:17,950
Cilindri from four hundred seventy-two thousand dollars,

521
00:20:17,950 --> 00:20:20,416
about two hundred thousand less than a

522
00:20:20,416 --> 00:20:21,000
Revuelto.

523
00:20:21,180 --> 00:20:23,598
We compare the two in detail in

524
00:20:23,598 --> 00:20:25,859
another video of this series.

525
00:20:26,210 --> 00:20:27,923
Tell us in the comments:

526
00:20:27,923 --> 00:20:30,851
would you spend fifty thousand dollars on

527
00:20:30,851 --> 00:20:33,421
carbon fiber, or put that money into

528
00:20:33,421 --> 00:20:34,778
a whole second car?

529
00:20:34,958 --> 00:20:37,676
And watch the rest of this Revuelto

530
00:20:37,676 --> 00:20:40,550
series, two secrets hidden inside it,

531
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:42,336
the Ferrari comparison,

532
00:20:42,336 --> 00:20:45,287
and the story of why Lamborghini built

533
00:20:45,287 --> 00:20:46,219
it this way.

534
00:20:46,570 --> 00:20:48,717
If your next purchase is a little

